Maheshvara praises lotus-eyed mighty deed and removal of Ravana-born darkness fear from worlds --- Shiva bids Rama console Bharata Kausalya Kaikeyi and Sumitra see Lakshmana mother regain Ayodhya delight friends and establish Ikshvaku line --- Shiva bids horse sacrifice supreme fame gifts to brahmins then heaven and salute father Dasharatha in vimana saved by son to Indra world --- Hearing Shiva Rama and Lakshmana bow to shining stainless-clad father with Lakshmana --- Overjoyed Dasharatha seats dearer-than-life son on lap embraces and speaks no heaven dear without Rama with Kaikeyi exile words stayed in heart --- Dasharatha says freed from sorrow as sun from mist seeing safe embraced sons saved as Ashtavakra saved brahmana and now knows gods ordained Purushottama to kill Ravana --- Dasharatha calls blessed Kausalya seeing home-returned Rama and blessed men seeing moist-anointed king and wishes to see meeting with devoted Bharata --- Dasharatha recalls fourteen years with Sita and wise Lakshmana with ended dwelling fruitful vow Ravana slain and gods pleased and bids long life in kingdom with brothers --- Rama folded hands begs favour that terrible I-abandon-you-with-son curse not touch Kaikeyi with son and king grants --- King embraces Lakshmana praises devoted service with Sita promising dharma fame and heaven when Rama pleased worshipped by three worlds Siddhas and seers as unmanifest secret heart of gods --- King tells Vaidehi no anger at abandonment done for purification with husband supreme deity then instructs sons and daughter-in-law and blazing goes to Indra world by vimana